+# Task — Implement JSON Pointer (RFC 6901)
+
+Added `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` in `src/index.ts`, with tests in `test/pointer.test.ts`
+(the RFC 6901 section 5 examples plus invalid-pointer and non-resolving cases) and a README section.
+Tests run with `npm test` (32 passing).
+
+Behaviour: the empty pointer returns the whole document; an invalid pointer or one that does not
+resolve throws an `Error`. See the decision-log on strictness for the choices made.
